    "message": "No longer maintained. MySqlConnector/Pomelo map Guid ↔ BINARY(16) natively with GuidFormat=Binary16 in the connection string, and .NET 8+ provides Guid.ToByteArray(bigEndian: true) and new Guid(bytes, bigEndian: true).",
